Awaken Mountain Bell Inscription II
4th Year of Benshi, Reign of Emperor Xuan of Han;
Forty-nine commanderies, earth cracked, walls crumbled;
Langya suffered most; six thousand lives lost;
The precipice shifted; the Awaken Mountain Bell tolled long

New hairstyle is available for a limited time.
Drifting ripples trace the dreams of fish;
Soft rain washes spring from fading youth.
